    <string name="open_a11y_settings">Open Accessibility Settings</string>
    <string name="cannot_open_settings">Unable to open system settings automatically. Please navigate to Accessibility manually.</string>
    <string name="steps_title">Accessibility Setup Guide</string>
    <string name="steps_body">1. Navigate to System Settings → Accessibility → Installed apps, then enable OpenTouchpad.\n2. If restricted by the system ("Restricted setting"), go to App info → ⋮ (top-right) → Allow restricted settings, then enable the service.\n3. Return to this app to customize panel dimensions, cursor sensitivity, and button mappings.</string>

